       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GROUPCALL.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 PAYLOAD.
          05 AMOUNT PIC 9(3) VALUE 12.
          05 DETAILS.
             10 ITEM PIC X(2) OCCURS 2 TIMES.
       01 RESULT-CODE PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           CALL "SERVICE" USING BY REFERENCE PAYLOAD
               RETURNING RESULT-CODE
           END-CALL
           IF AMOUNT = 25 DISPLAY "UPDATED"
           ELSE DISPLAY "UNCHANGED" END-IF
           GOBACK.
